<p>NOTES: Fiscal 1997 results include an after-tax charge of $11.0 million to write-off in-process research and development from the acquisition of Quintar Co in May 1997. Fiscal 1996 third quarter and nine months ended June 30, 1996 results include a charge of $1.0 million and $13.6 million, respectively, of after-tax purchase accounting adjustments.</p>
<p>Excluding the purchase accounting adjustments, Splash had net income of $4.0 million, or $0.32 per share, on 12.5 million shares for the third quarter of fiscal 1997, as compared to net income of $1.8 million for the same period last year.</p>
<p>Excluding the purchase accounting adjustments, Splash had net income of $10.8 million, or $0.89 per share, on 12.2 million shares for the first nine months of fiscal 1997, as compared to net income of $3.3 million for the same period in fiscal 1996.</p>
